{"parentUuid":"105a9dd6-23bd-48c4-8df9-7793c0da694e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a41bcc62-a611-4437-9167-d808322aeacd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Fix these 2 small issues:\n\n1. DUPLICATE PICKUP SECTION:\n   In the farmer profile page, the \"Pickup and Schedule\" section is appearing TWICE.\n   Find both instances and remove one - keep only one clean section.\n\n2. SUSPEND CONSUMER WITH REASON:\n   When moderator suspends a consumer, currently no reason is being asked.\n   \n   Add these changes:\n   - Show a popup with a text field asking \"Why are you suspending this consumer?\"\n   - The reason field is mandatory - cannot suspend without reason\n   - Examples: \"Multiple fake orders\", \"Abusive behavior\", \"Did not pay\"\n   - Save this reason in the consumers table\n   - On the consumer's profile page, show a red banner at the top:\n     \"Account Suspended: {reason}\"\n   - This banner should be visible to admin and moderator only\n   - The consumer themselves should see: \"Your account has been suspended. Please contact support.\".have we done this"},"uuid":"4a610555-c227-4da6-8033-f85594bedc0d","timestamp":"2026-06-16T18:41:11.815Z","permissionMode":"default","promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"a9aae61b-4a55-4f27-b7c0-22d7e61b6fa7","version":"2.1.178","gitBranch":"feat/suspend-consumer-reason-privacy"}
