{"parentUuid":"a000ca5b-8230-4a88-b4d3-60f970b3ac14","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a41bcc62-a611-4437-9167-d808322aeacd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NTWT7E8D7H8LaEC6z4N32g","type":"tool_result","content":"4b0634b feat(moderator): suspend consumer with mandatory reason; hide reason from buyer\nd9183a1 feat(i18n): add L(en,te) language helper + convert order-detail key strings (#8)\nde6c9a1 feat(consumer): show farmer courier/delivery badge on produce cards (#11)\n---DIFF of last commit---\ncommit 4b0634b801abf1fe6d11e1b69ba3dca9dfcecc69\nAuthor: veerendra <singampalliveerendra5@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Jun 16 18:33:39 2026 +0530\n\n    feat(moderator): suspend consumer with mandatory reason; hide reason from buyer\n    \n    Moderators must give a reason to suspend a consumer; the reason is saved\n    and shown to moderators in their consumers view. The consumer themselves\n    now only ever sees a generic \"Your account has been suspended. Please\n    contact support.\" message — at login and in the header banner — instead\n    of the moderator's internal reason.\n    \n    - consumer/login: suspended login returns the generic message only\n    - consumer/me: no longer returns suspended_reason to the buyer\n    - GlobalNav: red suspension banner (generic message) with dismiss\n    - ConsumerAuthContext: track + persist suspension state across reload\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n    Entire-Checkpoint: 3f8f353d4e30\n\n src/app/api/consumer/login/route.ts   |  9 ++++---\n src/app/api/consumer/me/route.ts      | 17 +++++++++----\n src/components/consumer/GlobalNav.tsx | 23 +++++++++++++++++-\n src/lib/ConsumerAuthContext.tsx       | 45 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 4 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"727166e0-281d-43f2-b53e-411316342be3","timestamp":"2026-06-16T18:41:21.983Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"4b0634b feat(moderator): suspend