 the spec wording:**\n\n1. The reason prompt uses the browser's native `window.prompt` (a popup with a text field), **not a styled modal**. Functionally it meets \"popup with a text field,\" but it's not a custom-designed dialog.\n2. The spec says \"on the consumer's **profile page**, show a red banner to admin/moderator.\" There's no dedicated consumer profile page — instead the reason banner shows inline in the moderator's **consumers list**. Same audience, same red banner, just a different surface.\n\nWant me to (a) replace the `window.prompt` with a proper styled modal, and/or (b) investigate the Pickup duplicate further if you can point me at the page where you see it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":574,"cache_read_input_tokens":45902,"output_tokens":1425,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":574,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1425,"cache_read_input_tokens":45902,"cache_creation_input_tokens":574,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":574},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cc7S1QuKY7cjkpw4gam3v","type":"assistant","uuid":"75efd701-8179-40a9-a446-d585e1dce8f0","timestamp":"2026-06-16T18:43:51.338Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"a9aae61b-4a55-4f27-b7c0-22d7e61b6fa7","version":"2.1.178","gitBranch":"feat/suspend-consumer-reason-privacy"}
