{"parentUuid":"876594ee-708b-42e8-bbbb-8016b31fbf60","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f74dfbbe-e023-4225-96f3-eaf795cf8ebf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Add new order flow statuses for completing orders:\n\nCurrently after farmer confirms an order, there's no proper way to mark the order as complete. Add these new statuses:\n\nFor PICKUP orders:\n1. After farmer mentions pickup date, add a button \"Picked Up / తీసుకువెళ్ళారు\" in farmer dashboard\n2. Farmer taps this when consumer comes and collects the order\n3. This marks order as completed and moves it from \"Active Orders\" to \"Order History\"\n\nFor COURIER/SHIPPED orders:\n1. After farmer mentions delivery date, add a button \"Shipped / షిప్ చేయబడింది\" in farmer dashboard  \n2. Farmer taps this when they hand over to courier or send the parcel\n3. Order status changes to \"Shipped\" - still shows in active orders\n4. Consumer now sees a \"Received / అందుకున్నాను\" button on their order\n5. When consumer confirms received, order moves to history\n\nOrder status timeline now becomes:\n- Order Placed\n- Payment Received  \n- Confirmed by Farmer\n- For Pickup: → Picked Up → Completed (moves to history)\n- For Courier: → Shipped → Received by Consumer → Completed (moves to history)\n\nAdd columns in orders table:\n- shipped_at (date when farmer marked shipped)\n- picked_up_at (date when picked up)\n- received_at (date when consumer marked received)\n\nShow clear timeline with all dates in order details for both farmer and consumer.\n\nBoth farmer and consumer should see notifications when status changes.\n\nAll buttons and statuses in English and Telugu.what about this"},"uuid":"39a52eed-35e2-4355-9416-f571ccf29cc7","timestamp":"2026-06-16T18:45:02.415Z","permissionMode":"default","promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"a9aae61b-4a55-4f27-b7c0-22d7e61b6fa7","version":"2.1.178","gitBranch":"feat/suspend-consume